  "project": {
    "label": "项目",
    "title": "项目简介",
    "paragraph1": "WearMask（Web-based Efficient AI Recognition of Masks） 是一个基于 <a href=\"https://github.com/dog-qiuqiu/Yolo-Fastest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Yolo-Fastest</a> 的深度学习项目，采用 <a href=\"https://pytorch.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">PyTorch</a> 训练，通过 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tencent/ncnn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">NCNN</a> 和 <a href=\"https://webassembly.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WebAssembly</a> 实现浏览器端实时运行。",
    "paragraph2": "项目已在 <a href=\"https://github.com/waittim/facemask-detection\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub（部署）</a> 和 <a href=\"https://github.com/waittim/mask-detector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">GitHub（训练）</a> 开源。请参阅 <a href=\"research/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">研究页面</a> 和 <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.2352/EI.2023.35.11.HPCI-229\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">论文（DOI）</a>。",
    "disclaimer": "WearMask 是研究与演示系统，并非医疗器械或诊断工具。"
  },
